V3 adapts packages/server/src/server/pid-lock.ts and atomic-file.ts from Paseo commit 0009a7e717a9f7ec587f55ca2985cb91b1310bd8 into packages/daemon/src/server/. The adapted files carry Vonvon Bot changes for its daemon lifecycle and file handling.

