V6 imports Paseo's Claude provider, complete AgentClient and AgentSession contracts, and their source and protocol dependency closure from the same pinned commit. The source inventory and modification reasons are in packages/daemon/src/agent/paseo/closure.json. The two plugin process launcher files retain their pinned bytes. Adapted files retain their upstream headers and carry modification notices for import paths, structural logger types, extracted store declarations, and strict TypeScript checks. Vonvon Bot's session-backend adapter is original integration code.

V6 keeps only user/project Claude settings. The slash-command reorder retains pinned runtime behavior with a TypeScript-only assertion. Raw SDK observation, error/usage repair and JSONL history live in original Vonvon Bot wrapper code, outside the copied provider.

V7 imports additional provider sources and their required test and utility closure from the same pinned Paseo commit. Import paths are relocated. The Pi extension registry and OpenCode bridge have the two documented logic adaptations; other compiler compatibility changes are type-only. The file inventory, modification notices, diagnostic ownership and hashes are recorded in packages/daemon/src/agent/paseo/closure.json.
